<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PORTAL KEGIATAN SANTRI PPRM</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        :root {
            --utama: #2563eb;
            --biru-muda: #3b82f6;
            --ungu: #8b5cf6;
            --hijau: #10b981;
            --oranye: #f59e0b;
            --merah: #ef4444;
            --putih: #ffffff;
            --abu-muda: #f8fafc;
            --teks: #1e293b;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef2ff 0%, #e0e7ff 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
            color: var(--teks);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            background: var(--putih);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
        }

        .header-img {
            width: 100%;
            max-height: 220px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--utama);
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            background: var(--putih);
        }

        .section-header {
            padding: 16px 24px;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .harian .section-header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--utama), var(--biru-muda)); }
        .mingguan .section-header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ungu), #a78bfa); }
        .bulanan .section-header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--hijau), #34d399); }
        .tahunan .section-header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--oranye), #fbbf24); }

        .section-body {
            padding: 20px 24px;
        }

        .item {
            padding: 14px 18px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--abu-muda);
            border-left: 4px solid;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .item:hover {
            transform: translateX(6px);
            background: #f1f5f9;
        }

        .harian .item { border-left-color: var(--utama); }
        .mingguan .item { border-left-color: var(--ungu); }
        .bulanan .item { border-left-color: var(--hijau); }
        .tahunan .item { border-left-color: var(--oranye); }

        .item-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--teks);
        }

        .item-desc {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
            .section-header { font-size: 1.1rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/ZRjt64B4/images.jpg" alt="Gambar Sekolah/Pondok" class="header-img">
            <h1>PORTAL KEGIATAN SANTRI PPRM</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Sumber Informasi Kegiatan Santri</p>
        </header>

        <div class="section harian">
            <div class="section-header">📅 Harian</div>
            <div class="section-body">
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">📚 SMP</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Jadwal dan kegiatan harian santri tingkat SMP</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">📖 MA</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Jadwal dan kegiatan harian santri tingkat MA</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">🎓 KULIAH</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Jadwal dan kegiatan harian santri tingkat Kuliah</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">🛠️ KHIDMAH</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Jadwal dan tugas harian khidmah santri</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section mingguan">
            <div class="section-header">🗓️ Mingguan</div>
            <div class="section-body">
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">📚 SMP</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Program dan kegiatan rutin setiap minggu — SMP</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">📖 MA</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Program dan kegiatan rutin setiap minggu — MA</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">🎓 KULIAH</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Program dan kegiatan rutin setiap minggu — Kuliah</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">🛠️ KHIDMAH</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Penugasan dan evaluasi khidmah mingguan</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section bulanan">
            <div class="section-header">📆 Bulanan</div>
            <div class="section-body">
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">📚 SMP</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Target, program & evaluasi bulanan — SMP</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">📖 MA</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Target, program & evaluasi bulanan — MA</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">🎓 KULIAH</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Target, program & evaluasi bulanan — Kuliah</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">🛠️ KHIDMAH</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Rencana dan penilaian kinerja khidmah bulanan</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section tahunan">
            <div class="section-header">🗓️ Tahunan</div>
            <div class="section-body">
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">📚 SMP</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Kalender pendidikan & agenda besar tahunan — SMP</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">📖 MA</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Kalender pendidikan & agenda besar tahunan — MA</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">🎓 KULIAH</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Rencana akademik dan kegiatan besar tahunan — Kuliah</div>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <div class="item-label">🛠️ KHIDMAH</div>
                    <div class="item-desc">Program kerja dan pengembangan jangka panjang</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            &copy; 2025 PORTAL KEGIATAN SANTRI PPRM — Semua Hak Dilindungi
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
